- The depth cap came from a half-empty row on My bookings; it now shows "Popular searches from London" when there are no recent searches.

**QA:** clean at 1440, 1024 and 390 on 13 pages. No console errors, failed requests, sideways scroll, dashes or upscaled images of mine.

